  "ruleText": "Env-C 302.02 “Analyte list” means a list of the matrix, method, and analyte combinations that a laboratory has been accredited to perform.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-C 300) #12065, eff 1-1-17; ss by #13291, eff 11-23-21",
